    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just hard to see \"one small corner\" when the whole world feels like it's just passing right through me. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. it feels more like i'm just taking up space that doesn't belong to me. like i’m just a mistake in the scenery.",
